<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34653" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμφρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρήν</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in one's mind</i> or
				<i>senses, sensible</i>: opp., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> to one mad, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σε Ζεὺς
				τίθησιν ἔμφρονα</span>&lt;*&gt; brings thee <i>to
				thy senses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				848
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. εἰμί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					1026
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. καθίσταμαι</span> I come
				<i>to myself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				306
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιητὴς</span> . . 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔ. ἐστίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					719c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ μανικῶν . . ἑξεις ἔμφρονας
				ἔχειν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				791b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> to one dead,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτ᾽ ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1237
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				2.3.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. γίγνεσθαι</span> to
				<i>recover from</i> a swoon or lethargy, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				136
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> to one
			asleep, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rational, intelligent</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα
			ἔ.</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴδωλα
			ἄφρ</span>., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.4.4
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωή, βίος ἔ.</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				521a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ti.</u>
				36e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πρεσβυτῶν ἔ. παιδιά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					769a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη -εστέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1359b6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν ἐς ἥβην ἐξικώμεθ᾽
				ἔμφρονες</span> when we come to years <i>of
			discretion</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				583.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sensible, prudent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1126
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				9.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				436
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. σωφροσύνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.84
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. περί τι</span>
			<i>wise</i> about or in a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				809d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δημιουργῶν ἢ τῶν ἄλλων
				τῶν ἐ. ἀνδρῶν</span>
			<i>experts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hipparch.</u>
				226c
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όνως</span>
			<i>sensibly, wisely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				396d
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				104
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phalar.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					67.3
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
